**What this experiment tests**: First successful Stage 2 conditional diffusion training. The 1D U-Net denoiser with frozen encoder from exp003 will generate f0 and amp via DDIM sampling. Expected f0 RPA ~80-92%, Amp Corr ~0.5-0.7.

**Key evaluation points** (per supervisor plan):
- Diffusion vs baseline comparison (exp003: RPA=97.14%, Amp=0.645)
- Training stability (train/test loss divergence)
- Multi-sample diversity (oracle vs mean)
